#6500
The Path To Orrund~
   A stony path leaves the laneway above and drops into a cleft of grey
rock, rutted deep by the wheels of iron-wagons. Every cart that passes here
goes down toward the front loaded with dwarven steel and comes back empty. A
cairn of black stones stands by the way, one stone for every dwarf who went
into the old mine and did not come out. The path runs north toward the
mountain; the laneway lies back up the slope.
~
