#6501
The Foot Of The Mountain~
   The path reaches the foot of a rugged mountain, where the scrub forest
grows thick and dark against the rock. The trees have been cut back from the
road for a spear's length on either side, so that nothing can wait in them.
Porters pass here bent double under bundles of blades. The path climbs north
and drops away south.
