#6503
The Summit Gate~
   The path ends on a windswept shoulder near the top of the mountain, where
two great doorways are cut into the living rock. The one to the west is the
gate of the hold of Orrund, carved with hammers and anvils; the one to the
east leads to the working mine, and its lintel is black with soot. The wind
never stops here, and it carries the ring of the forges up out of the stone.
The path leads down to the south.
~
